              span Years of experience
              .c-divider
            li.p-section-top-about__portrait
              strong 98.5%
              span Client Satisfaction
              .c-divider
            li.p-section-top-about__portrait
              strong 2149+
              span Beautiful Photo
              .c-divider
            li.p-section-top-about__portrait
